    'Authors and Event Organisers</a>'+
'    <ul>'+
'      <li> <a href="https://eptcs.org/style.shtml" target="_top">LaTeX style file and'+
'           formatting instructions</a>'+
'           <ul>'+
'             <li><a href="https://eptcs.web.cse.unsw.edu.au/eptcsstyle.zip" target="_top">eptcsstyle.zip</a>'+
'           </ul>'+
'      <li> <a href="https://eptcs.org/bibliographystyle.shtml" target="_top">The EPTCS Bibliography Style</a>'+
'      <li> <a href="https://eptcs.org/doi/" target="_top">Digital Object Identifiers</a>'+
