'           and LaTeX encodings of common non-ASCII characters</a>'+
'      <li> <a href="https://eptcs.org/copyright.html" target="_top">Copyright</a>'+
'    </ul>'+
'<li><a href="https://eptcs.org/apply.shtml" target="_top">'+
